    "abstract": {
      "en": "Main river network of the Caucasus ecoregion derived from the HydroSHEDS global hydrographic database. Source river lines were cropped to the Caucasus ecoregion boundary and filtered to retain principal channels. Supports hydrological mapping, basin analysis, freshwater connectivity assessment, and regional environmental planning.",
