    "notes": {
      "en": "<ul><li>Source: HydroSHEDS river network; Caucasus ecoregion subset with main rivers filtered.</li><li>UP_CELLS indicates upstream contributing cells (flow accumulation proxy).</li><li>HydroSHEDS is derived primarily from SRTM elevation; local channel position may differ from surveyed hydrography.</li><li>Bounding box is approximate Caucasus extent; use MapX Update values from source for precision.</li><li>Homepage: https://www.hydrosheds.org/</li></ul>",
